# Never stageable in a public repo — the pre-commit scan catches patterns,
# this catches the file. Placed above the `!.env.example` negation below rather
# than appended at the end, because gitignore gives the last matching pattern
# the final word: after that line, `.env.*` would override the negation this
# repository carries.
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
credentials.json

